    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 3.76,
      "end": 4.27,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 5.15,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 5.67,
      "end": 9.41,
      "en": "And we're bringing you another great elementary lesson for all those elementary learners.",
      "zh": "我们为所有这些小学学习者带来了另一个很棒的小学课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 9.93,
      "end": 14.81,
      "en": "In today's lesson, we've got some excellent language that will help you to describe someone's appearance.",
      "zh": "在今天的课程中，我们有一些出色的语言可以帮助您描述某人的外表。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 15.39,
      "end": 18.97,
      "en": "It's something that everyone has learned before in school, describing people.",
      "zh": "这是每个人在学校之前学到的东西，描述人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 19.47,
      "end": 21.99,
      "en": "So we're going to review that and give you some better phrases.",
      "zh": "所以我们将回顾一下并给你一些更好的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 22.52,
      "end": 24.28,
      "en": "Some real English phrases.",
      "zh": "一些真正的英语短语。"
    },
