      "en": "That's my brother!",
      "zh": "那是我亲兄弟！"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 91.06,
      "end": 93.34,
      "en": "All right, so interesting dialogue.",
      "zh": "好吧，很有趣的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 93.88,
      "end": 94.66,
      "en": "Small world.",
      "zh": "小世界。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 95.1,
      "end": 96.56,
      "en": "It is a small world.",
      "zh": "这是一个小世界。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 96.84,
      "end": 99.68,
      "en": "I don't know how I would feel about dating my friend's brother.",
      "zh": "我不知道和我朋友的兄弟约会我会有什么感觉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 99.98,
      "end": 100.14,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 100.7,
      "end": 101.84,
      "en": "No, I wouldn't feel good about it.",
      "zh": "不，我不会觉得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 101.94,
      "end": 102.06,
      "en": "Why?",
      "zh": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 102.52,
      "end": 108.58,
      "en": "Well, because if you break up with the brother, then like, that means you'll have to end the friendship with your best friend.",
